+
+## Canonical inventory
+
+```sh
+PYTHONPATH=/reference python3 - <<'PY'
+import json
+from pathlib import Path
+from tools.k_rule_inventory import inventory_verification
+print(json.dumps(inventory_verification(Path("/reference/k-proof")), indent=2, sort_keys=True))
+PY
