+| 108–110 | `rule-2b43fdbce21c598f6cfa95b3146c8de11d9da189c5a51c432315e84d3bb3fb49` | `DEFINITION` | First guarded equation of the final `musicResult` summary: append 4 exactly when the terminal current is 4. |
