+| 101–102 | `rule-bda12c0b7b12bf5165f63c4f9e337f373a5c25f912e8e05c596663abc36bd377` | `DEFINITION` | Structural recursive step of `scanCurrent`, consuming the strict `IntSeq` tail. |
